graph TB
    subgraph WVA["Workload Variant Autoscaler"]
        direction TB

        subgraph Controllers["Reconciliation Controllers"]
            ConfigMapCtrl["ConfigMap Controller<br/>Bootstraps & live-updates config"]
            HPACtrl["HPA Controller<br/>Reconciles HorizontalPodAutoscalers"]
            InferencePoolCtrl["InferencePool Controller<br/>Reconciles InferencePool resources"]
            ScaledObjectCtrl["ScaledObject Controller<br/>Reconciles KEDA ScaledObjects"]
        end

        subgraph Engine["Optimization Engine Pipeline"]
            KalmanFilter["Kalman Filter Engine<br/>Predictive scaling"]
            GPURebalancer["GPU Rebalancer<br/>Reads ResourceQuota & Nodes"]
            ScaleFromZero["Scale-from-Zero Engine<br/>Dynamic client discovery"]
        end

        subgraph Actuator["Scaling Actuator"]
            DirectActuator["DirectActuator<br/>Patches Scale subresources"]
        end

        Datastore["Shared Datastore<br/>Active autoscaling targets"]

        ConfigMapCtrl -->|populates config| Datastore
        HPACtrl -->|tracks targets| Datastore
        InferencePoolCtrl -->|tracks targets| Datastore
        ScaledObjectCtrl -->|tracks targets| Datastore

        Datastore -->|feeds| KalmanFilter
        KalmanFilter -->|signals| GPURebalancer
        GPURebalancer -->|decisions| DirectActuator
        ScaleFromZero -->|discovers zero-replica workloads| DirectActuator
    end

    %% External watched resources
    ConfigMapCR["ConfigMap Resources"]
    HPACR["HPA Resources"]
    InferencePoolCR["InferencePool CRs<br/>inference.networking.k8s.io"]
    ScaledObjectCR["ScaledObject CRs<br/>keda.sh"]

    ConfigMapCR -->|watched by| ConfigMapCtrl
    HPACR -->|watched by| HPACtrl
    InferencePoolCR -->|watched by| InferencePoolCtrl
    ScaledObjectCR -->|watched by| ScaledObjectCtrl

    %% External dependencies
    Prometheus["Prometheus<br/>HTTP API"]
    K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS"]

    Prometheus -->|metrics queries<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer| Engine
    DirectActuator -->|patches Scale subresource| K8sAPI

    %% Scaling targets
    Deployments["Deployments"]
    LWS["LeaderWorkerSets"]

    DirectActuator -->|scales| Deployments
    DirectActuator -->|scales| LWS

    %% Observability
    MetricsEndpoint[":8443/metrics<br/>TokenReview + SAR<br/>Self-signed TLS"]
    HealthEndpoint[":8081/healthz + /readyz<br/>Unauthenticated"]

    %% Styling
    style ConfigMapCtrl fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HPACtrl fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style InferencePoolCtrl fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ScaledObjectCtrl fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style KalmanFilter fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style GPURebalancer fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style ScaleFromZero fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style DirectActuator fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff
    style Datastore fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style K8sAPI fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style ConfigMapCR fill:#f5a623
    style HPACR fill:#f5a623
    style InferencePoolCR fill:#f5a623
    style ScaledObjectCR fill:#f5a623
    style Deployments fill:#7ed321
    style LWS fill:#7ed321
    style MetricsEndpoint fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style HealthEndpoint fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
